brary/view/leading-effective-engineering/9781098148232/\n\nManaging at scale\n\nExecutive Leadership Fundamentals in 60 Minutes: Learn What Is Expected and Required to Excel\nhttps://www.oreilly.com/videos/executive-leadership-fundamentals/0636920888994/\n\nTech Leadership Tuesday: How to Manage Underperforming Individuals and Teams\nhttps://www.oreilly.com/videos/tech-leadership-tuesday/0642572018903/\n\nManaging Teams\nhttps://www.oreilly.com/library/view/the-managers-path/9781491973882/ch05.html\n\nManaging Multiple Teams\nhttps://www.oreilly.com/library/view/the-managers-path/9781491973882/ch06.html\n\nManaging Managers\nhttps://www.oreilly.com/library/view/the-managers-path/9781491973882/ch07.html\n\nInstructions: all cards for each piece of  content linked above should include:\n\n-topic\n\n-format\n\na large date if it’s a live event and a small time.",
        "title": "Lead Forward: O'Reilly's Manager Development Series",
        "intro": "Whether you’re a first-time manager or a seasoned leader, the live events, on-demand courses, and essential reads on this page will help you as you progress along your management journey. The more you engage, the more you’ll take back to your teams, so make the most of what’s here!\n\nReminder: Managers are required to complete two manager excellence training events or resources in 2026, and this requirement is tied to your end-of-year bonus. Each missed training reduces the bonus opportunity by $500. All content offered on this page counts toward that requirement.",
